[[rust-hocon]]
documents: support/test_writing/rust/README.txt, support/test_writing/python/README-hwut_hocon.txt
'hwut_hocon::parse' in Rust parses the HOCON subset into the tree 'hwut_hocon.py' builds -- positions, kinds, faults -- and gives the same verdict on 3000 mutated headers from the same seed: held against the Python test's GOOD files by link.
